commit 9978be446fe494826d654eea4696def11c968f69
Author: luoye-cpu <3412829159@qq.com>
Date:   Sat Aug 29 14:48:56 2026 +0800

    3FCompare K1-K5: presenter resize提权/末级重采样修正/Diag API+Redraw导出
    
    K1 修复暂停/pacing/最小化时交换链尺寸不同步:
    - 新增 ChainMatchesWindow() 统一判据(含位深+0x0保护)
    - TimedTextThread 的 pacing 跳过与 devicePollOnly 早退在链失配时
      必须落到 PresentTimedText 执行 resize，不再无限等下一个出帧信号
    - PresentTimedText 改用 ChainMatchesWindow()
    
    K2 末级重采样量化桶:
    - PrepareScaledVideo 宽高各自算 bucket(X=源宽8%,Y=源高8%)
    - 就近取整替代向上取整，保证 cache≈destination
    
    K3 末级 lanczos support 动态展宽:
    - SampleLanczos3/Panorama 增加 outputSize 参数
    - support=3/max(downscale,0.05) clamp[3,12],消除2×下采样欠采样
    
    K4+K5 新增 API(不改 ABI/ConfigVersion/Snapshot version):
    - FFF3FP_GetRenderTargetInfo: swap/client/dest 尺寸+位深
    - FFF3FP_Redraw: 导出 renderer Redraw() 快路径

